===QD_SECTION_NATURAL_LANGUAGE===
microsrv 模块的 AI 规则：定义该模块的行为约束、资源使用和调度策略。
AI.qd 读取本规则，将自然语言约束转化为结构化规则供执行层确定性执行。
===QD_SECTION_STRUCTURED_RULES===
{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "rule_microsrv_001",
      "condition": "子服务注册",
      "action": {
        "type": "approve",
        "target": "register",
        "channel": "ai",
        "note": "微服务注册需 AI 备案"
      },
      "priority": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "rule_microsrv_002",
      "condition": "端口冲突检测",
      "action": {
        "type": "arbitrate",
        "target": "port",
        "priority_owner": "ai",
        "note": "端口占用由 AI 仲裁"
      },
      "priority": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "rule_microsrv_003",
      "condition": "文件传输路径",
